        <owl:disjointWith rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ci#WorkOfProductComponent"/>
        <owl:disjointWith rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ci#WorkOfTemporaryComponent"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A Work specialization representing the physical part of a ConstructionComponent. It describes the construction object and its technical characteristics and may be decomposed into construction components, product components, and material resources.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="it">Una specializzazione di Work che rappresenta la parte fisica di un ConstructionComponent. Descrive l&apos;oggetto costruito e le relative caratteristiche tecniche e può essere scomposta in ConstructionComponent, ProductComponent e MaterialResource.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>WorkOfConstructionComponent</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


