            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A Work specialization representing the physical part of a TemporaryComponent. It describes the temporary or auxiliary work and its technical characteristics and may be decomposed into product components, equipment resources, and material resources.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="it">Una specializzazione di Work che rappresenta la parte fisica di un TemporaryComponent. Descrive l&apos;opera temporanea o ausiliaria e le relative caratteristiche tecniche e può essere scomposta in ProductComponent, EquipmentResource e MaterialResource.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>WorkOfTemporaryComponent</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


